cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository accompanies an unpublished manuscript prepared for submission
  to Information Sciences. Until publication, cite this dataset or contact the
  corresponding author for guidance.
type: dataset
title: "NoiseProj-CF: Public Results and Evidence Data"
abstract: >-
  Processed result tables supporting the manuscript "NoiseProj-CF:
  Noise-Adjusted Low-Rank Projection for Compact and Corruption-Robust Dense
  Retrieval". The release covers the frozen six-dataset, three-encoder core
  protocol and targeted recent-adaptor and corruption-location extensions.
